{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalReebExists","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalReebExists","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Category.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Preadditive.Basic"],"declarations":35,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.categorical_reeb_exists","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.categorical_reeb_exists","kind":"theorem","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L153-L192","doc":"**Existence of the categorical Reeb derivation**.\n\nEvery quantum observable universe with a maximal torus `T` and\nweight decomposition `(π_H, π_V)` admits a Reeb derivation\n`(ξ, θ_A)` satisfying all three properties.\n\nThe construction is:\n1. `ξ` is the infinitesimal generator of the `T ≅ U(1)` action\n   (`d/dt|_{t=0}` of the one-parameter subgroup).\n2. `θ_A` is the Maurer–Cartan form dual to `ξ`.\n3. `ι_ξ` is the interior product (contraction with ξ).\n4. `d` is the differential from the QOU's Kähler structure.\n\nFormalising this requires Lie algebra infrastructure (infinitesimal\ngenerators of compact group actions on categorical objects) which\nis not available in Mathlib as of 2026-03.\n\n**Was an axiom; now proved (2026-11-15), but only because the\nstatement is weak.** The fields do not exclude `ξ = θ = d = ι_ξ = 0`,\nso the zero Reeb structure on `wd.forms` witnesses it. The intended\ncontent (`ξ` is the torus generator) is not recorded by the structure\nand is open in Lean (bean `qou-n2un`). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:thm:categorical-reeb-exists","label":"thm:categorical-reeb-exists","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.fromWeightDecomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.fromWeightDecomposition","kind":"def","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L117-L151","doc":"**Smart constructor** for `CategoricalReeb`.\n\nPackages Reeb derivation components from a weight decomposition\ninto the `CategoricalReeb` structure, using `wd.proj_V` for the\nvertical projection.\n\nThis is a constructor (`.mk`), not a derivation — the caller\nmust supply `ξ`, `θ_A`, `d`, `ι_ξ`, and the three property proofs.\nSee `categorical_reeb_exists` below for the existence axiom.\n\nRef: [witten1988] https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01223371 ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.kernel_horizontal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.kernel_horizontal","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L115-L115","doc":"**Kernel** (horizontal forms = ker ι_ξ). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.proj_V_idem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.proj_V_idem","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L113-L113","doc":"Idempotency of the vertical projection. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.normalisation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.normalisation","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L111-L111","doc":"**Normalisation**: `ξ ≫ θ = θ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.vertical_generator","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.vertical_generator","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L109-L109","doc":"**Vertical generator**: `d ≫ π_V ≫ ι_ξ = ξ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.contract_xi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.contract_xi","kind":"def","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L107-L107","doc":"The interior product (contraction) `ι_ξ : Ω¹(A) → A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.d","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.d","kind":"def","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L105-L105","doc":"The differential `d : A → Ω¹(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.proj_V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.proj_V","kind":"def","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L103-L103","doc":"The vertical projection `π_V : Ω¹(A) → Ω¹(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.theta","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.theta","kind":"def","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L101-L101","doc":"The canonical 1-form `θ_A : A → 𝟙` dual to `ξ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.xi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.xi","kind":"def","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L99-L99","doc":"The Reeb derivation `ξ : A → A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.forms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.forms","kind":"def","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L97-L97","doc":"The object of 1-forms `Ω¹(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.A","kind":"def","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L95-L95","doc":"The Frobenius–Hopf object `A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.mk","kind":"ctor","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L92-L92","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb","kind":"structure","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L87-L115","doc":"**Categorical Reeb derivation** (inlined from `def:categorical-reeb`):\nthe endomorphism `ξ : A → A` generating the `T`-action on the\nFrobenius–Hopf object `A`, with canonical 1-form `θ_A`.\n\nRef: [witten1988] https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01223371 ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:categorical-reeb","label":"def:categorical-reeb","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WeightDecomposition.proj_V_idem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WeightDecomposition.proj_V_idem","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L85-L85","doc":"Idempotency of vertical projection. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WeightDecomposition.proj_H_idem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WeightDecomposition.proj_H_idem","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L83-L83","doc":"Idempotency of horizontal projection. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WeightDecomposition.complementary","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WeightDecomposition.complementary","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L81-L81","doc":"Complementarity: `π_H + π_V = id`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WeightDecomposition.proj_V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WeightDecomposition.proj_V","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L79-L79","doc":"The vertical projection `π_V` (non-zero weight). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WeightDecomposition.proj_H","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WeightDecomposition.proj_H","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L77-L77","doc":"The horizontal projection `π_H` (weight-0). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WeightDecomposition.forms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WeightDecomposition.forms","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L75-L75","doc":"The object of `k`-forms `Ω^k(A)` in `C`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WeightDecomposition.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WeightDecomposition.mk","kind":"ctor","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L72-L72","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WeightDecomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WeightDecomposition","kind":"structure","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L67-L85","doc":"**Weight decomposition** (inlined from `def:weight-decomposition`):\nthe `T`-weight decomposition of differential forms into horizontal\n(weight-0) and vertical (non-zero weight) components.\n\nRef: [lusztig1993] https://doi.org/10.1007/978-0-8176-4717-9 ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:weight-decomposition","label":"def:weight-decomposition","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/weight-decomposition.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MaximalTorus.rank","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MaximalTorus.rank","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L65-L65","doc":"**Maximality**: rank of the torus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MaximalTorus.diagonal_action","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MaximalTorus.diagonal_action","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L62-L62","doc":"**Diagonal action**: the image of `embed` is abelian. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MaximalTorus.embed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MaximalTorus.embed","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L60-L60","doc":"The torus embeds into the gauge group. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MaximalTorus.torusGroup","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MaximalTorus.torusGroup","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L58-L58","doc":"The torus carries a group structure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MaximalTorus.torusType","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MaximalTorus.torusType","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L56-L56","doc":"The diagonal automorphism type (abstracting `T ≅ U(1)^r`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MaximalTorus.numWeights","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MaximalTorus.numWeights","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L54-L54","doc":"The number of weight spaces of `V` under the torus action. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MaximalTorus.fibreFunctor_faithful","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MaximalTorus.fibreFunctor_faithful","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L52-L52","doc":"**Faithfulness** of the fibre functor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MaximalTorus.fibreFunctor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MaximalTorus.fibreFunctor","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L50-L50","doc":"The fibre functor `ω : C → Type*` (from the QOU). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MaximalTorus.V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MaximalTorus.V","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L48-L48","doc":"The fundamental object `V` of categorical dimension 2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MaximalTorus.hopfObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MaximalTorus.hopfObj","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L46-L46","doc":"The Frobenius–Hopf object `A` in `C` (from the QOU). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MaximalTorus.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MaximalTorus.mk","kind":"ctor","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MaximalTorus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MaximalTorus","kind":"structure","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-reeb-exists.lean#L38-L65","doc":"**Maximal torus** (inlined from `def:maximal-torus`): the subgroup\nof `Aut⊗(ω)` acting diagonally on each weight space of the\nfundamental object `V`.\n\nRef: [lusztig1993] https://doi.org/10.1007/978-0-8176-4717-9 ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:maximal-torus","label":"def:maximal-torus","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/maximal-torus.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}